  user       = aws_iam_user.user.name
  policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.policy.arn
}
💡 What Was Added
aws_iam_user_policy_attachment: The resource that performs the attachment.

user = aws_iam_user.user.name: References the user already defined above (iamuser_kareem_t2q3).

policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.policy.arn: References the policy already defined above (iampolicy_kareem_t2q3).

Terraform will infer the dependencies automatically — it creates the user and policy first, then attaches the policy to the user.

